# Help: figlet, a missing command names its package, help -d, and man's browser.
Output help.gif
Require cash
Set Width 1000
Set Height 560
Source "_settings.tape"

Type "figlet -f slant cash"
Enter
Sleep 2200ms
Type "bat README.md"
Enter
Sleep 2500ms
Type "help -d lsof fuser ss top figlet"
Enter
Sleep 2800ms
Type "man sed"
Enter
Sleep 2800ms
PageDown@900ms 3
Sleep 1800ms
Escape
Sleep 1500ms
